&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cash App reaches 59 million monthly active customers, and top-of-funnel growth is accelerating. We&#39;re looking for a Growth Manager to be the GM for activation and habituation. You&#39;ll own the goals for how customers find their first meaningful moment in Cash App and turn it into a lasting habit, and you&#39;ll decide how to hit them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blurs growth and product. You won&#39;t hand requirements off to someone else. On this team, you are the product owner for your growth levers. You&#39;ll set the strategy, own the roadmap and experiment backlog, and work directly with Engineering, ML, Design, and Analytics to ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every lever is on the table: onboarding flows, in-app surfaces and prompts, eligibility logic, incentive mechanics, notifications, and customer communications across push, email, SMS, and in-app. You&#39;ll pick the lever most likely to move the metric, run the experiment, and scale what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll sit on the Cash App Engagement Marketing team, which gives you deep customer context, lifecycle craft, and a strong peer group. But this isn&#39;t a traditional marketing role. You&#39;ll be just as comfortable shipping a product change as you are writing and launching a message or building the model behind an upsell engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People who thrive here have come from growth product, growth marketing, lifecycle, business operations, and consumer analytics. What they share is a drive to own outcomes, an experimentation reflex, and the ability to move between strategy and the details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What&#39;s Unique About This Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale.&lt;/strong&gt; With 59M monthly actives and rapid top-of-funnel growth, your experiments read in days, not months, and your wins move numbers that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the goal and the levers. Your roadmap shapes what Cash App builds, not just what it sends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Every lever is fair game.&lt;/strong&gt; Product changes, in-app experiences, incentives, and comms are all yours to test and combine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI frontier.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll help define what growth looks like as decisioning becomes increasingly AI-driven. Every experiment you run feeds, and is shaped by, the AI and automation stack we&#39;re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Will&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own activation and habituation goals end-to-end as the GM for your area. Define the opportunity landscape, set strategy, decide where to invest, and deliver measurable impact on activation and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap and experiment backlog for your area. Score every idea against expected impact and effort, whether it&#39;s a product change, an in-app surface, an incentive, or a message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run rapid experiments across a wide range of levers, including onboarding, post-onboarding upsell, contact opt-in, behavioral notifications, real-time intervention, mobile wallet adoption, referrals, churn prevention, and winback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship directly with Engineering, ML, and Design. That covers product changes like onboarding flows, in-app prompts, eligibility logic, and incentive mechanics, as well as the customer communications that support them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose your own funnel. Size opportunities, find friction, read experiment results, and iterate without waiting on an analyst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the frontier on AI decisioning and automation, and help define how growth work evolves as AI moves further into the decisioning layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring what you learn back to the Engagement Marketing team so wins scale across Cash App&#39;s broader lifecycle programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence strategy across Product, Analytics, Martech, Creative, and Brand as a true peer of these teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in growth product, growth marketing, lifecycle marketing, CRM, growth strategy, business operations, or a consumer-facing analytical role in a B2C tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning a growth goal end-to-end, from opportunity through measurable impact, including real ownership of what got built and shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping the product experience itself and working directly with engineers to ship it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort moving between strategy and hands-on execution. You&#39;re as willing to write and launch a message as you are to define a product change or build the model behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data instincts. You can size an opportunity, build an impact model, and diagnose a funnel from first principles, and you&#39;re comfortable pulling and interpreting data yourself, whether through SQL, AI tools, or other means. Experience with data modeling or opportunity sizing frameworks required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experimentation experience. You know how to build a backlog, design rigorous tests, and use results to drive compounding improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a CRM or marketing automation platform (e.g., Braze, Iterable, Salesforce Marketing Cloud), or strong reason to believe you&#39;d ramp on one quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI tools as a core part of how you work, with the ability to automate, accelerate, and scale output in ways that set a new standard for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured, takeaway-first communication. You can turn complex analysis and ambiguous situations into crisp strategy and actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a growth PM or in another role where you owned a product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with onboarding, activation, or referral programs specifically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with regulated or trust-sensitive products (e.g., fintech, financial services, or healthcare)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with incentive mechanics or in-app personalization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Technologies We Use and Teach&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Braze, Iterable, or similar CRM and marketing automation platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL and AI-assisted analysis for self-serve opportunity sizing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI tools (Claude Code, Goose, or others) for strategy, execution, and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;EEOC&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is an equal opportunity employer evaluating all employees and job applicants without regard to identity or any legally protected class. We will consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records for employment in accordance with state and local laws and “fair chance” ordinances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;Want to learn more about what we’re doing to build a workplace that is fair and square? Check out our&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot;&gt;I+D page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While there is no specific deadline to apply for this role, U.S. roles are typically open for an average of 55 days before being filled by a successful candidate. Please refer to the date listed at the top of this job page for when this role was first posted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate’s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find a location’s zone designation, please refer to this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone A:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$163,600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$245,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone B: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$152,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$228,200 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone C:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$144,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$216,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone D:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$135,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$203,600 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
